  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p><a href=\"https://boc.inke.cn/react/tools/activity-data-query/index.html?module_name=constellation&amp;month=202403\" class=\"external-link\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://boc.inke.cn/react/tools/activity-data-query/index.html?module_name=constellation&amp;month=202403</a></p><p>Dear all，<br />&nbsp;<br />&ldquo;守护摩羯座&rdquo;活动已于1月17日下线，现对活动榜单奖励发放。<br />&nbsp;<br />辛苦@叶导 审批；<br />辛苦@灿灿&nbsp;&nbsp;配置；<br />&nbsp;<br />一、榜单资源奖励明细如下：</p><table><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 63.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 24.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 58.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 58.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 45.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 58.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 45.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 64.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 45.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 58.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 30.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 58.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 30.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 64.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 30.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 64.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 35.0pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 49.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 64.5pt;\" /> <col class=\"\" style=\"width: 35.0pt;\" /> </colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>摩羯座代言人称号</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>超秀卡*5分钟 *1张</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>守护摩羯座直播间角标</td><td><br /></td><td><br /></td><td>摩羯流光勋章</td><td>主播，守护摩羯座获得，计数型</td><td><br /></td><td>摩羯星河勋章</t